        "TileImage": "$($repository dc13abd0-f991-41b1-8550-eb29e1ce422e).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47. Our final contract is on Netanyahu himself, as well as two of his top generals. All of them have escaped to the Gamma hospital in Hokkaido to attempt facial reconstruction surgery. If we let them get away now, 47, we may never know what they look like again. This is our most important contract ever. Also wear a funny yellow motorcycle suit from a dead guy in the morgue okay byeeeeeee",
